  "title": "FLUX: A pipeline for MEG analysis",
  "description": "This dataset contains MEG data collected as part of the FLUX pipeline project, a standardized analysis and preprocessing pipeline for magnetoencephalography (MEG) research. The dataset was reorganized into BIDS format from an original OpenNeuro dataset to support reproducible MEG analysis workflows across multiple research sites.",
